CONTEXT City INCLUDES Registry FROM "../contexts/registry_plain.adl", Shops FROM "../contexts/shops.adl"
CONTEXT Registry INCLUDES Towns FROM "../contexts/towns.adl"

CONTEXT City IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT City
{+ The main file states the inclusions of the whole system.
The second statement says that Registry includes Towns, although the file of Registry does not say so itself. +}

RELATION customer[Shops.Shop*Registry.Person]
RULE local : customer |- Shops.located;Registry.residence~
ROLE Clerk MAINTAINS local

ENDCONTEXT
